              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বসন্ত — bôsôntô — \"spring\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বসন্ত (bôsôntô) is Sanskrit vasanta, \"spring season\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama."
